1
00:00:03,450 --> 00:02:03,450
Visit our website for more: turkision.com

2
00:02:03,940 --> 00:02:08,490
No living being was harmed during
the filming of this series

3
00:02:08,630 --> 00:02:11,490
Söğüt

4
00:02:12,230 --> 00:02:14,620
Episode 117

5
00:02:18,450 --> 00:02:20,040
Osman.

6
00:02:20,420 --> 00:02:23,610
He who crosses borders
does not live long.

7
00:02:29,385 --> 00:02:31,665
I will find the gold(s) and bring it to you.

8
00:02:40,385 --> 00:02:42,905
You will release the sons of Beys.

9
00:02:43,085 --> 00:02:45,615
Temporarily, if necessary.

10
00:02:50,240 --> 00:02:51,950
Commander Nayman.

11
00:02:52,900 --> 00:02:54,950
We did what you asked of us.

12
00:02:55,340 --> 00:02:57,340
Gold was on the way.

13
00:02:59,230 --> 00:03:01,320
Something must have happened.

14
00:03:01,370 --> 00:03:02,740
We will find and bring it.

15
00:03:02,750 --> 00:03:04,330
Free our children.

16
00:03:04,620 --> 00:03:08,400
If necessary, we will give you more gold.

17
00:03:08,520 --> 00:03:09,870
Don't

18
00:03:09,920 --> 00:03:11,270
Don't.

19
00:03:14,010 --> 00:03:16,060
If you kill them...

20
00:03:16,710 --> 00:03:18,810
Then you will not be able to take gold.

21
00:03:21,960 --> 00:03:23,530
Forgive them now.

22
00:03:24,820 --> 00:03:27,150
Forgive them so that we may all win.

23
00:03:29,460 --> 00:03:31,790
I have cured your son.

24
00:03:32,320 --> 00:03:35,830
And in return, you plan a game for me.

25
00:03:38,560 --> 00:03:41,900
I will kill the sons of Beys.

26
00:03:48,550 --> 00:03:52,655
You have time until tomorrow evening.

27
00:03:53,875 --> 00:03:56,615
You will bring me the gold, Osman.

28
00:03:57,065 --> 00:04:00,425
Otherwise, the sons of Beys will die.

29
00:04:02,695 --> 00:04:04,555
Not only them...

30
00:04:04,995 --> 00:04:08,585
I will take your children from you too.

31
00:04:10,335 --> 00:04:12,765
One soul is more valuable than
a thousand gold coins.

32
00:04:14,675 --> 00:04:16,795
I'll get that gold for you.

33
00:04:18,665 --> 00:04:23,725
You won't touch my sons, nor
the sons of my Beys.

34
00:04:25,295 --> 00:04:29,535
I keep my promises unlike you.

35
00:04:31,395 --> 00:04:34,625
If there is no gold, there
will be no children.

36
00:04:37,675 --> 00:04:40,195
This is my last word.

37
00:04:47,655 --> 00:04:48,995
Take them.

38
00:06:02,240 --> 00:06:03,970
Don't ever worry.

39
00:06:04,990 --> 00:06:07,500
I will bring your sons to you safely.

40
00:06:10,830 --> 00:06:12,220
Don't worry.

41
00:06:15,040 --> 00:06:16,540
Rest assured.

42
00:06:21,800 --> 00:06:23,170
For now, stay safe.

43
00:06:24,040 --> 00:06:25,190
Osman Bey.

44
00:06:26,760 --> 00:06:28,110
Stop!

45
00:06:31,450 --> 00:06:33,250
Are you going like this
without an account?

46
00:06:40,160 --> 00:06:41,780
Yakup Bey.

47
00:06:43,660 --> 00:06:47,920
If one hair on my son's
head is hurt...

48
00:06:48,230 --> 00:06:52,760
I swear, I, first you and then
your followers....

49
00:06:52,920 --> 00:06:54,280
Continue.

50
00:06:55,550 --> 00:07:01,120
Continue so that no difference remains
between you and the unbeliever who has gone.

51
00:07:02,330 --> 00:07:03,850
Osman Bey.

52
00:07:04,420 --> 00:07:05,990
Do you have gold?

53
00:07:06,120 --> 00:07:07,600
Let's say I have it.

54
00:07:08,870 --> 00:07:11,370
Many innocent people have
a right to that gold.

55
00:07:12,250 --> 00:07:16,180
But you feared for your lives
and wanted to pay the tax.

56
00:07:19,330 --> 00:07:22,090
It turns out that you are not as
brave as you are, Candar Bey.

57
00:07:24,310 --> 00:07:28,720
Do you think we are
afraid for ourselves?

58
00:07:29,040 --> 00:07:30,800
We fear for our children.

59
00:07:31,270 --> 00:07:33,250
We fear for our people.

60
00:07:33,460 --> 00:07:35,710
He who fears death
does not remain free.

61
00:07:36,560 --> 00:07:40,330
And whoever is not free, there is no
difference between him and the dead.

62
00:07:40,470 --> 00:07:43,210
Well, when your son was
martyred on the battlefield...

63
00:07:43,260 --> 00:07:44,630
did your heart ache?

64
00:07:45,750 --> 00:07:47,350
Or would you be proud of it?

65
00:07:49,400 --> 00:07:53,470
Martyrdom is definitely
the greatest status.

66
00:07:53,920 --> 00:07:57,710
But where is the fight?
Where is the field?

67
00:07:57,800 --> 00:08:00,040
Here is the fight and here is the field!

68
00:08:02,470 --> 00:08:05,410
The oppressors want us to
be under their command!

69
00:08:05,670 --> 00:08:09,390
But many valiants are against this.

70
00:08:22,850 --> 00:08:24,380
I will solve this.

71
00:08:24,470 --> 00:08:25,830
How?

72
00:08:26,020 --> 00:08:28,240
I'll find the gold and give it to Nayman.

73
00:08:31,520 --> 00:08:33,679
I will return your children to you.

74
00:08:34,030 --> 00:08:35,350
Don't ever worry.

75
00:08:39,450 --> 00:08:41,650
So be it as you say, Osman Bey.

76
00:08:42,360 --> 00:08:44,159
Let it be as you say.

77
00:08:46,950 --> 00:08:52,120
As I said, I hope
you have nothing to do with the gold issue.

78
00:08:53,950 --> 00:08:58,460
Be comfortable and reassured.

79
00:09:02,620 --> 00:09:04,190
I will return them to you.

80
00:09:34,185 --> 00:09:36,195
I will be your end, Olof.

81
00:09:36,375 --> 00:09:39,455
I will bury you and your soldiers, Turgut.

82
00:09:41,425 --> 00:09:44,205
I am content to lie beside my warriors.

83
00:09:44,245 --> 00:09:46,805
But I wonder, are
you ready to die?

84
00:09:47,025 --> 00:09:48,355
Come here.

85
00:10:07,445 --> 00:10:09,205
Olof, we have to go.

86
00:10:09,245 --> 00:10:11,335
- Olof.
- No!

87
00:10:11,355 --> 00:10:12,905
Olof, we can't win, walk!

88
00:10:12,935 --> 00:10:14,155
We will fight.

89
00:10:14,215 --> 00:10:15,475
We must fight, Olof.

90
00:10:15,535 --> 00:10:17,465
To earn the love of the God.

91
00:10:17,555 --> 00:10:18,365
Olof!

92
00:10:18,505 --> 00:10:20,005
Walk!

93
00:10:20,145 --> 00:10:21,535
Come on, walk, Olof.

94
00:10:21,535 --> 00:10:22,815
Walk.

95
00:10:23,125 --> 00:10:24,015
No!

96
00:10:24,125 --> 00:10:25,155
- Olof!
- Stop!

97
00:10:44,195 --> 00:10:45,725
Come on, valiants.

98
00:10:50,205 --> 00:10:51,765
My soldiers!

99
00:10:51,935 --> 00:10:53,755
We'll get revenge, Olof.

100
00:10:54,085 --> 00:10:55,475
They are coming.

101
00:10:55,525 --> 00:10:56,465
You go from here.

102
00:10:56,585 --> 00:10:58,985
Come on!

103
00:11:01,065 --> 00:11:02,585
You come with me.

104
00:11:41,285 --> 00:11:43,855
There is no news from my Bey yet.

105
00:11:43,935 --> 00:11:45,805
What are we going to do, Konur Alp?

106
00:11:45,845 --> 00:11:51,235
What if Nayman played a game
for my Bey when he didn't get the gold?

107
00:11:52,755 --> 00:11:55,635
Does he not know then that
he will never be able to have it?

108
00:11:56,245 --> 00:11:58,115
Definitely knows.

109
00:11:58,585 --> 00:12:01,175
But Nayman's actions
just don't make sense.

110
00:12:01,885 --> 00:12:05,435
Brother Konur, shall we go
to Söğüt to see?

111
00:12:08,875 --> 00:12:10,935
Nobody will go anywhere.

112
00:12:11,185 --> 00:12:13,265
Our job is to wait for our Bey here.

113
00:12:13,305 --> 00:12:14,615
We'll wait.

114
00:12:15,365 --> 00:12:17,295
Now...

115
00:12:19,925 --> 00:12:22,035
Send messengers to the observers in
the vicinity.

116
00:12:22,765 --> 00:12:24,405
To watch the place well.

117
00:12:26,675 --> 00:12:28,495
We must have an eye behind us.

118
00:12:28,595 --> 00:12:32,455
If a guest comes without an invitation,
he will get his due from our swords.

119
00:12:35,105 --> 00:12:38,695
We'll do what you say, brother, but what are
we going to do with this gold?

120
00:12:40,255 --> 00:12:42,115
Let my Bey come first.

121
00:12:42,235 --> 00:12:44,285
He is the one who will say what to do.

122
00:12:44,375 --> 00:12:45,695
Good.

123
00:13:14,845 --> 00:13:16,345
Stop it, Olof.

124
00:13:23,585 --> 00:13:24,945
Olof.

125
00:13:24,955 --> 00:13:26,425
They are here.

126
00:13:26,965 --> 00:13:28,285
Run!

127
00:13:28,295 --> 00:13:29,855
Run, run, run!

128
00:13:34,865 --> 00:13:36,175
Dan.

129
00:13:36,215 --> 00:13:37,205
No, Olof.

130
00:13:37,255 --> 00:13:38,305
I can't leave Dan.

131
00:13:38,315 --> 00:13:39,825
We are few in number.

132
00:13:54,255 --> 00:13:55,555
Dan.

133
00:13:59,150 --> 00:14:00,740
Turgut.

134
00:14:04,445 --> 00:14:06,715
Your death will be by my hands, Turgut.

135
00:14:07,115 --> 00:14:10,175
People like you only
kill innocent people.

136
00:14:10,815 --> 00:14:12,695
They take innocent lives.

137
00:14:13,805 --> 00:14:15,155
Come here.

138
00:14:15,545 --> 00:14:16,765
Attack!

139
00:14:44,175 --> 00:14:45,365
Come here.

140
00:14:49,495 --> 00:14:52,485
I will cut off your head
with my own hands, Turgut

141
00:14:59,035 --> 00:15:03,075
Doesn't sound like you crushing
and killing the weak, does it?

142
00:15:03,275 --> 00:15:07,575
The fate of people like you is to obey to
us and death.

143
00:15:08,945 --> 00:15:11,225
My Bey, what are we going
to do with these two?

144
00:15:11,235 --> 00:15:13,105
These two will do us good, Acar.

145
00:15:14,075 --> 00:15:16,685
Osman Bey thought of a good
move for them.

146
00:15:19,345 --> 00:15:21,215
Now take these two dogs.

147
00:15:28,130 --> 00:15:31,440
You won't die easily, Frigg.

148
00:15:31,720 --> 00:15:34,150
You are in my hands until you speak.

149
00:15:34,950 --> 00:15:39,230
You will tell the Beys all of
İsmihan's tricks one by one.

150
00:15:41,020 --> 00:15:42,580
I won't tell.

151
00:15:45,870 --> 00:15:48,990
I won't tell, you can't make me talk.

152
00:15:52,300 --> 00:15:54,010
Do you trust Olof?

153
00:15:54,630 --> 00:15:57,750
If he was going to save you, he would
have saved you a long time ago.

154
00:15:58,450 --> 00:16:03,430
Olof will come and I will kill you all.

155
00:16:06,670 --> 00:16:08,800
I know how to make you talk.

156
00:16:09,330 --> 00:16:11,590
Right now we need
her alive, Bengi Hatun.

157
00:16:13,770 --> 00:16:16,550
And I will send you to
your brother's side.

158
00:16:19,700 --> 00:16:21,290
Bengi Hatun.

159
00:16:22,460 --> 00:16:23,600
Leave me.

160
00:16:23,640 --> 00:16:24,910
Leave me to kill her.

161
00:16:24,950 --> 00:16:27,530
You're not going near Frigg anymore.

162
00:16:27,560 --> 00:16:30,120
You're not going into this cage.

163
00:16:38,085 --> 00:16:39,585
Alçiçek.

164
00:16:40,250 --> 00:16:42,800
Alçiçek, I don't know
what to say, daughter.

165
00:16:42,920 --> 00:16:44,420
What is happening?

166
00:16:44,500 --> 00:16:48,040
If I had known this would happen,
I would never have done this.

167
00:16:49,170 --> 00:16:51,680
Now, you can't meet your
loved one because of me.

168
00:16:52,040 --> 00:16:54,190
Speak clearly, mother, I don't understand.

169
00:16:58,970 --> 00:17:00,780
I couldn't kill Frigg.

170
00:17:02,050 --> 00:17:05,609
Now if Frigg talks,
Osman Bey will know everything.

171
00:17:06,020 --> 00:17:08,159
About me, Esma and İsmihan.

172
00:17:08,530 --> 00:17:09,970
What are you saying?

173
00:17:10,368 --> 00:17:13,480
Because you wanted to...

174
00:17:14,369 --> 00:17:15,990
I pulled Frigg into a trap.

175
00:17:17,819 --> 00:17:20,720
But I made a game and sent word to frigg

176
00:17:20,869 --> 00:17:22,130
She knew about the trap.

177
00:17:23,229 --> 00:17:25,169
She wouldn't have been
caught, but they caught her.

178
00:17:25,199 --> 00:17:27,029
If she speaks...

179
00:17:27,579 --> 00:17:30,350
you won't
be able to meet with Aktemur...

180
00:17:30,560 --> 00:17:32,970
he will cut off my head,
your father's head, and all of our heads.

181
00:17:33,060 --> 00:17:34,790
Osman Bey will not forgive us.

182
00:17:36,830 --> 00:17:38,370
You said you didn't know
about the poison.

183
00:17:38,390 --> 00:17:39,170
I did not know.

184
00:17:39,410 --> 00:17:41,810
So, tell Osman Bey, and
he will understand.

185
00:17:41,940 --> 00:17:45,160
No one will believe us after they learn
that Esma gave the poison.

186
00:17:45,410 --> 00:17:47,900
We have to get Frigg out of
the tribe before she speaks.

187
00:17:47,940 --> 00:17:49,180
Otherwise, everything will end.

188
00:17:49,240 --> 00:17:50,760
But who will do this?

189
00:17:51,280 --> 00:17:52,930
The ladies' eyes are on me.

190
00:17:56,690 --> 00:17:58,070
I will do it.

191
00:18:02,660 --> 00:18:05,050
Leave me, I'll get out on my own

192
00:18:05,100 --> 00:18:06,440
Good.

193
00:18:20,510 --> 00:18:23,050
Don't take your eyes off her, Alçiçek.

194
00:18:49,900 --> 00:18:51,230
I will save you.

195
00:18:51,820 --> 00:18:55,710
But do not speak.

196
00:18:56,890 --> 00:18:58,190
What?

197
00:18:58,960 --> 00:19:00,280
Why?

198
00:19:09,190 --> 00:19:11,010
My mother sent me.

199
00:19:12,150 --> 00:19:14,020
It is the order of Mother Sultan.

200
00:19:15,260 --> 00:19:17,770
I have to do this in
order to marry Aktemur.

201
00:19:21,230 --> 00:19:22,800
Love...

202
00:19:24,280 --> 00:19:25,850
Love.

203
00:19:28,620 --> 00:19:31,170
You set me free for love, right?

204
00:19:35,670 --> 00:19:37,460
Shut up and listen to me.

205
00:19:42,635 --> 00:19:45,675
If we hand over the gold to the people,
they will rest, my bey.

206
00:19:46,355 --> 00:19:48,875
We will not hand over the gold to the people.

207
00:19:49,105 --> 00:19:51,715
Why?
is there a problem?

208
00:19:52,215 --> 00:19:54,305
Nayman has kidnapped Beys' sons.

209
00:19:54,885 --> 00:19:56,595
If we don't give him the gold...

210
00:19:57,245 --> 00:19:58,615
Then he will kill them.

211
00:20:05,845 --> 00:20:07,115
And what shall we do now, my Bey?

212
00:20:07,865 --> 00:20:09,935
Will we obey to these infidels?

213
00:20:10,165 --> 00:20:13,225
Nayman is like a dam built in
front of the Turkmens.

214
00:20:13,865 --> 00:20:17,375
We will tear down that dam
and cut off its head.

215
00:20:18,395 --> 00:20:20,735
But until then, our movements
will be kept confidential.

216
00:20:20,755 --> 00:20:24,295
Our swords are sharp and
our strength is permanent.

217
00:20:25,695 --> 00:20:27,215
Well, my bey.

218
00:20:28,205 --> 00:20:31,435
Are we really going to
give them the gold?

219
00:20:34,685 --> 00:20:36,575
We'll give them gold.

220
00:20:37,605 --> 00:20:39,405
Now, hear me well.

221
00:20:57,675 --> 00:20:59,065
Turgut.

222
00:21:00,235 --> 00:21:01,795
Osman.

223
00:21:04,145 --> 00:21:10,155
I will take your souls for
what you took from me.

224
00:21:11,135 --> 00:21:13,445
The end that awaits you...

225
00:21:14,175 --> 00:21:15,915
will be your death.

226
00:21:22,865 --> 00:21:24,565
We got through them, Olof

227
00:21:26,215 --> 00:21:27,605
Come on.

228
00:21:28,485 --> 00:21:29,985
Commander Olof.

229
00:21:30,645 --> 00:21:34,235
For the sake of the great Jesus, your
wound is very serious.

230
00:21:34,325 --> 00:21:36,105
We must wrap it.

231
00:21:36,495 --> 00:21:38,005
We won't stop.

232
00:21:38,145 --> 00:21:41,155
We'll take Dan and Frigg.

233
00:21:41,645 --> 00:21:43,525
Have mercy on us, O great Jesus.

234
00:21:43,815 --> 00:21:46,855
If only we bandaged the wound
first and then we'd go get them.

235
00:21:47,125 --> 00:21:49,185
We've lost a lot
of men, Olof.

236
00:21:49,215 --> 00:21:51,045
We have to go to İnegöl.

237
00:21:51,065 --> 00:21:53,335
We take support from there
and attack them again.

238
00:21:53,605 --> 00:21:54,965
But now...

239
00:21:55,025 --> 00:21:56,215
Shall we go back?

240
00:21:56,255 --> 00:21:59,445
Isn't it better that we take
prisoners from them?

241
00:21:59,565 --> 00:22:03,275
Sister, read your prayers and don't
get involved in matters you don't know.

242
00:22:03,435 --> 00:22:05,895
Had it not been for my prayers, your
blood would have watered the earth.

243
00:22:06,025 --> 00:22:07,335
Shut up!

244
00:22:16,695 --> 00:22:18,525
We'll go back to İnegöl!

245
00:22:25,485 --> 00:22:26,785
Good.

246
00:22:26,895 --> 00:22:29,955
I go before you and tell the doctors.

247
00:22:30,815 --> 00:22:33,695
Let the most skilled doctors
dress your wound.

248
00:22:34,255 --> 00:22:36,765
I will not stay and meddle
in matters I do not know.

249
00:22:38,385 --> 00:22:39,885
She can go, Olof

250
00:22:40,085 --> 00:22:42,625
We make too much noise when
we're outnumbered.

251
00:22:43,205 --> 00:22:45,015
It is better for us to disperse.

252
00:22:47,555 --> 00:22:49,425
You and you...

253
00:22:49,665 --> 00:22:50,895
Go with the nun.

254
00:22:51,325 --> 00:22:53,965
Be careful, come on.

255
00:23:04,285 --> 00:23:06,295
We'll give the gold to Olof.

256
00:23:07,175 --> 00:23:09,245
But not real gold.

257
00:23:10,305 --> 00:23:12,145
The fake ones.

258
00:23:14,965 --> 00:23:19,085
Turgut Bey wanted to hit Olof
for a long time. Is he alive?

259
00:23:19,485 --> 00:23:21,035
News has come from Turgut.

260
00:23:21,305 --> 00:23:23,365
Olof somehow escaped.

261
00:23:23,935 --> 00:23:25,265
My Bey.

262
00:23:25,575 --> 00:23:28,105
As long as we hand
him the fake gold...

263
00:23:28,385 --> 00:23:30,225
Why even give it to Olof?

264
00:23:30,545 --> 00:23:34,375
Wouldn't it be better if we hand him over to Nayman directly and take the Beys' sons?

265
00:23:34,835 --> 00:23:36,635
If we give it to Nayman...

266
00:23:36,815 --> 00:23:39,155
We can only take Beys' sons.

267
00:23:39,585 --> 00:23:41,965
But if we give the gold to Olof...

268
00:23:42,205 --> 00:23:45,365
and we tell Nayman the gold was with Olof...

269
00:23:45,485 --> 00:23:47,985
then, we will win two victories.

270
00:23:48,065 --> 00:23:50,115
And we'll beat the two dogs together.

271
00:23:51,995 --> 00:23:53,795
It is true what you say, my Bey.

272
00:23:54,865 --> 00:24:00,135
Now it's time for us to think about how
to give the gold to Olof.

273
00:24:01,085 --> 00:24:02,895
We'll do this with Frigg.

274
00:24:03,215 --> 00:24:05,285
Ladies will be on it.

275
00:24:06,125 --> 00:24:07,625
Konur.

276
00:24:08,415 --> 00:24:11,715
You will take this gold to the caravansary
in Çamlıpınar.

277
00:24:12,875 --> 00:24:16,085
Olof and Frigg are going to find the gold
as if they've got it.

278
00:24:16,625 --> 00:24:18,175
Your command, my Bey.

279
00:24:25,625 --> 00:24:27,005
My Bey.

280
00:24:27,195 --> 00:24:29,155
Is this game going to fool Nayman?

281
00:24:29,425 --> 00:24:30,875
Will he believe right away?

282
00:24:31,005 --> 00:24:33,305
This depends on
our persuasion ability.

283
00:24:34,435 --> 00:24:38,745
But first let's get into
that dog's hole and then we'll see.

284
00:24:38,885 --> 00:24:40,095
Come on.

285
00:24:40,155 --> 00:24:42,035
Let everyone go to work.

286
00:24:42,925 --> 00:24:44,665
Come on, Alps.

287
00:24:55,065 --> 00:24:56,375
Bala.

288
00:24:56,985 --> 00:25:01,575
Osman Bey sent the gold to the caravansary
in Çamlıpınar.

289
00:25:01,825 --> 00:25:03,365
Good.

290
00:25:07,785 --> 00:25:09,165
I will survive from here.

291
00:25:09,565 --> 00:25:14,655
I will kill you all one by one.

292
00:25:15,105 --> 00:25:17,945
You can't do anything
anymore, Frigg.

293
00:25:18,135 --> 00:25:19,635
Let her go up.

294
00:25:22,445 --> 00:25:24,155
Get out of here, Frigg.

295
00:25:27,745 --> 00:25:29,095
Bengi.

296
00:25:29,795 --> 00:25:31,305
It will be your turn.

297
00:25:31,855 --> 00:25:33,865
I will be back for you all.

298
00:25:36,475 --> 00:25:38,335
Shall we send warriors with her?

299
00:25:39,405 --> 00:25:40,995
Alps!

300
00:25:41,205 --> 00:25:43,535
Take Frigg to Yenişehir first.

301
00:25:43,775 --> 00:25:46,275
Then, go to the caravansary.

302
00:25:47,895 --> 00:25:50,485
I should go too, just in case.

303
00:25:50,805 --> 00:25:53,055
Where are you going, Ayşe Hatun?

304
00:25:53,715 --> 00:25:56,575
We came to take the
bride's box to Yenişehir.

305
00:25:57,115 --> 00:25:59,395
Isn't there someone else to go with them?

306
00:26:04,005 --> 00:26:06,925
May my mother Ayşe stay and I will go.

307
00:26:07,685 --> 00:26:09,515
And you two will solve the rest.

308
00:26:12,795 --> 00:26:14,115
Good.

309
00:26:14,555 --> 00:26:18,275
You've done your first mission as a female
warrior, Alçiçek.

310
00:26:19,195 --> 00:26:20,505
Come on.

311
00:26:31,305 --> 00:26:34,035
Sisters!
Alps!

312
00:26:36,175 --> 00:26:37,635
Come on, let's go.

313
00:27:11,335 --> 00:27:12,875
Osman Bey is coming.

314
00:27:35,425 --> 00:27:36,775
Welcome.

315
00:27:41,435 --> 00:27:42,985
Thank you.

316
00:27:45,025 --> 00:27:47,155
We scattered Olof's armies.

317
00:27:47,495 --> 00:27:49,515
They dispersed into the woods.

318
00:27:49,845 --> 00:27:55,325
Olof ran away, but
I caught his dishonorable brother

319
00:27:55,705 --> 00:27:58,255
You hit Olof hard.

320
00:27:59,485 --> 00:28:01,045
He can go wherever he wants.

321
00:28:01,225 --> 00:28:02,965
Olof's fate is known.

322
00:28:09,105 --> 00:28:11,845
Congratulations on your victory, Turgut Bey.

323
00:28:12,765 --> 00:28:14,125
Thank you.

324
00:28:15,865 --> 00:28:18,235
And now I have to tell you.

325
00:28:19,105 --> 00:28:20,425
Say it.

326
00:28:23,095 --> 00:28:27,535
I see that Olof is
never far from Ülgen Hatun.

327
00:28:27,985 --> 00:28:31,365
We attacked him a lot and he
never suspected a thing.

328
00:28:31,775 --> 00:28:33,725
They obviously believed she was a nun.

329
00:28:34,815 --> 00:28:36,345
They respect her.

330
00:28:36,705 --> 00:28:39,555
That's fine, fine.

331
00:28:39,865 --> 00:28:42,585
When we take İnegöl, Ülgen
will be of great use to us.

332
00:28:44,145 --> 00:28:45,385
We hurt Olof.

333
00:28:45,775 --> 00:28:50,235
Now, it's time to beat Nayman
and Olof together.

334
00:28:54,825 --> 00:28:56,355
- Boran.
- My Bey.

335
00:28:57,565 --> 00:28:59,755
Take this dog and send him to Yenişehir.

336
00:29:02,185 --> 00:29:04,075
And we're going to Nayman

337
00:29:04,115 --> 00:29:05,615
Your command, my Bey.

338
00:29:05,655 --> 00:29:07,205
Dear brothers...

339
00:29:11,035 --> 00:29:13,785
Something they never
expected will happen.

340
00:29:13,905 --> 00:29:15,695
We'll take the sons first.

341
00:29:15,925 --> 00:29:17,885
And after we take them...

342
00:29:17,955 --> 00:29:20,155
We will destroy the enemy
and move on.

343
00:29:20,415 --> 00:29:23,045
We will cut their flesh to pieces...

344
00:29:23,285 --> 00:29:27,315
until they have no power left
in front of us.

345
00:29:27,505 --> 00:29:32,945
As long as we are united, we won't leave
any power around, Inshallah.

346
00:29:34,785 --> 00:29:37,805
As long as we have brothers
like these behind us...

347
00:29:38,665 --> 00:29:42,205
Nothing will happen to us, thank Allah.

348
00:29:44,965 --> 00:29:46,275
Thank you.

349
00:29:47,695 --> 00:29:49,055
Come on.

350
00:29:57,805 --> 00:30:00,595
Put more observers on the roads leading
to the caravansary, Aykurt.

351
00:30:01,355 --> 00:30:02,935
Nayman's men are everywhere.

352
00:30:03,605 --> 00:30:07,085
Let us take good measures
and reach the caravansary in secret.

353
00:30:07,475 --> 00:30:10,985
We will deliver the boxes to the
caravansary safely, Inshallah.

354
00:30:11,325 --> 00:30:13,075
Warriors, come on.

355
00:30:17,855 --> 00:30:21,215
My Bey must be about to start his campaign.
We must arrive quickly.

356
00:30:22,275 --> 00:30:23,555
We will.

357
00:30:23,665 --> 00:30:26,865
Let's make sure the road
is safe first and we'll get there.

358
00:31:44,175 --> 00:31:45,765
Sir, what are they doing?

359
00:31:51,655 --> 00:31:56,645
They believe that these lands will be
theirs if a bird lands on the nest...

360
00:31:57,565 --> 00:32:01,515
that they are building and
makes a home for itself.

361
00:32:01,605 --> 00:32:03,365
It's a habit.

362
00:32:03,625 --> 00:32:06,055
They tied their future to a bird, then.

363
00:32:06,105 --> 00:32:07,635
Good then.

364
00:32:09,665 --> 00:32:14,425
There are birds' nests around their camp,
shall I target them?

365
00:32:14,735 --> 00:32:17,515
If their prayers was accepted,
the sky would rain bones.

366
00:32:19,455 --> 00:32:21,185
We turned our backs on the truth.

367
00:32:21,565 --> 00:32:24,225
May the birds fly free in our homeland.

368
00:32:52,735 --> 00:32:53,945
Alps!

369
00:32:55,125 --> 00:32:56,495
Let's take a break.

370
00:33:21,185 --> 00:33:22,745
Wait for me, Olof

371
00:33:24,345 --> 00:33:26,935
Wait.

372
00:33:42,975 --> 00:33:44,545
Warriors!
It's a trap!

373
00:34:06,745 --> 00:34:08,445
Come on, from this side.

374
00:35:00,095 --> 00:35:02,645
You smell like a trick, Osman.

375
00:35:04,255 --> 00:35:06,765
One smells oneself first.

376
00:35:07,575 --> 00:35:09,335
Nayman's order is definitive.

377
00:35:10,145 --> 00:35:13,985
He said, "Cut off Osman's head if
he comes empty-handed."

378
00:35:18,385 --> 00:35:20,475
Since Nayman trusts you...

379
00:35:22,345 --> 00:35:24,205
You must not be very smart.

380
00:35:26,785 --> 00:35:28,635
How did you know I
came empty-handed?

381
00:35:29,045 --> 00:35:31,615
I can't see the gold, Osman.

382
00:35:31,875 --> 00:35:33,955
Then the eye of your heart
must be closed, Shaman.

383
00:35:38,965 --> 00:35:43,155
If Nayman campaigns at your word...

384
00:35:45,155 --> 00:35:46,715
Woe to him.

385
00:36:20,995 --> 00:36:25,205
If he's empty-handed, he must
have brought a piece of information, Shaman.

386
00:36:29,485 --> 00:36:31,025
Say, Osman.

387
00:36:53,115 --> 00:36:55,185
Is what you have on your hands
is the blood of the innocent?

388
00:36:55,225 --> 00:36:57,115
It is the blood of a vow.

389
00:37:02,425 --> 00:37:08,195
The offerings do not seek
possession and conquests as we do.

390
00:37:08,775 --> 00:37:11,825
They live to be sacrificial to God.

391
00:37:16,735 --> 00:37:18,455
Where is the gold?

392
00:37:20,285 --> 00:37:22,325
Where are the sons of Beys?

393
00:37:23,595 --> 00:37:25,975
Show me that they are alive.

394
00:37:27,795 --> 00:37:29,895
Then I will tell you where the gold is.

395
00:37:36,025 --> 00:37:37,345
Bring them.

396
00:37:46,605 --> 00:37:48,365
Pray for Mother Sultan.

397
00:37:48,735 --> 00:37:51,815
Otherwise, we wouldn't have released
you before we killed you.

398
00:37:52,935 --> 00:37:55,475
The wedding would be a
dream if they knew the truth.

399
00:37:57,185 --> 00:37:59,245
I made you run so
that they wouldn't know.

400
00:37:59,865 --> 00:38:02,415
Calm down, calm down.

401
00:38:09,705 --> 00:38:11,405
Come on, go now.

402
00:38:11,505 --> 00:38:13,325
But don't you talk.

403
00:38:13,385 --> 00:38:14,715
Never.

404
00:38:15,195 --> 00:38:16,715
I didn't see anything.

405
00:38:17,975 --> 00:38:19,525
Alçiçek...

406
00:38:20,185 --> 00:38:22,045
I will never forget your help.

407
00:38:43,675 --> 00:38:45,535
I have to make them believe.

408
00:38:54,045 --> 00:38:56,815
You're wrong, you look
like your mother.

409
00:38:57,665 --> 00:38:58,985
I liked you, Alçiçek.

410
00:39:02,115 --> 00:39:03,655
Wait for me, Olof, come on.

411
00:39:07,155 --> 00:39:10,415
Osman, where is the gold?

412
00:39:17,665 --> 00:39:19,225
I can not hear you.

413
00:39:34,535 --> 00:39:38,575
If I don't hear
about the place of gold...

414
00:39:40,935 --> 00:39:46,025
I will start killing them by cutting off their ears.

415
00:39:53,785 --> 00:39:56,305
The great Commander Nayman...

416
00:40:03,465 --> 00:40:04,995
is betrayed

417
00:40:10,085 --> 00:40:12,385
Saying this is not that easy.

418
00:40:15,225 --> 00:40:16,525
Speak.

419
00:40:19,255 --> 00:40:20,975
Olof has the golds.

420
00:40:24,135 --> 00:40:25,365
I couldn't hear you.

421
00:40:25,375 --> 00:40:26,725
You heard me.

422
00:40:28,085 --> 00:40:29,885
You heard correctly.

423
00:40:31,225 --> 00:40:33,085
Olof has the golds.

424
00:40:42,035 --> 00:40:44,595
Yenişehir

425
00:40:45,545 --> 00:40:47,075
Snake Frigg got caught.

426
00:40:47,165 --> 00:40:48,985
We found an antidote
to the poison.

427
00:40:49,245 --> 00:40:52,765
Now it's time to find
out who poisoned the tribe.

428
00:40:53,585 --> 00:40:56,295
Don't worry, we'll know that soon, too.

429
00:40:56,965 --> 00:40:58,285
We will know.

430
00:41:02,885 --> 00:41:04,705
Alçiçek is late.

431
00:41:05,665 --> 00:41:07,255
Can I come in?

432
00:41:07,695 --> 00:41:09,475
Come in, Alçiçek.

433
00:41:17,985 --> 00:41:19,575
Alçiçek.

434
00:41:25,445 --> 00:41:27,185
Frigg fell into the game.

435
00:41:30,945 --> 00:41:32,755
Alps have been sent after her.

436
00:41:35,635 --> 00:41:37,185
Alps!

437
00:41:37,405 --> 00:41:38,685
Get up.

438
00:41:38,745 --> 00:41:40,515
Frigg's gone, come on, catch her!

439
00:41:51,315 --> 00:41:53,935
And I learned that gold
is also in the caravansary.

440
00:41:54,575 --> 00:41:57,195
She'll go now and tell Olof.

441
00:42:02,145 --> 00:42:03,345
It's done.

442
00:42:03,985 --> 00:42:06,195
Now keep the promise you
made to me, Alçiçek.

443
00:42:06,645 --> 00:42:08,075
Who poisoned my son?

444
00:42:16,265 --> 00:42:17,685
Tell me, Alçiçek.

445
00:42:17,945 --> 00:42:19,115
You said you'd tell me.

446
00:42:19,685 --> 00:42:21,325
Who did this to my son?

447
00:42:22,495 --> 00:42:23,665
I did.

448
00:42:48,225 --> 00:42:50,865
How do you do this to my son?

449
00:42:53,355 --> 00:42:56,195
They threatened me with my brother,
I had no other solution!

450
00:42:56,245 --> 00:42:57,525
Shut up!

451
00:42:57,615 --> 00:43:00,165
My son was in a bad condition
because of you!

452
00:43:00,985 --> 00:43:03,305
Was this in exchange for
our favor to you, Esma?

453
00:43:03,895 --> 00:43:04,985
Forgive me.

454
00:43:05,925 --> 00:43:07,385
For my brother's soul.

455
00:43:08,335 --> 00:43:09,385
I put the poison.

456
00:43:10,025 --> 00:43:13,715
I got scared after that and backed
off, but I didn't have enough time.

457
00:43:15,345 --> 00:43:18,595
Forgive me, Malhun Hatun, I am very sorry.

458
00:43:19,395 --> 00:43:20,935
Please, forgive me.

459
00:43:24,665 --> 00:43:26,525
If anyone made a mistake, it was me.

460
00:43:26,905 --> 00:43:28,835
I am the one who brought Esma here.

461
00:43:29,435 --> 00:43:30,955
I wish we had never come.

462
00:43:38,925 --> 00:43:40,635
Who gave it to you?

463
00:43:40,765 --> 00:43:42,495
Who gave you the poison?

464
00:43:42,555 --> 00:43:45,135
Did Bengi Hatun give it to you?

465
00:43:46,225 --> 00:43:49,825
Who did this?
Who asked you to do this?

466
00:43:50,415 --> 00:43:51,775
Avcı.

467
00:43:55,035 --> 00:43:57,595
Avcı Bey gave me the poison.

468
00:44:02,055 --> 00:44:03,635
İsmihan did it.

469
00:44:26,215 --> 00:44:29,935
Loyalty is not bought with
gold or intimidation.

470
00:44:32,365 --> 00:44:34,855
You've been betrayed by
Olof who's under your command.

471
00:44:34,915 --> 00:44:36,415
Osman.

472
00:44:37,335 --> 00:44:41,275
If you are planning a game...

473
00:44:41,415 --> 00:44:43,415
No game.

474
00:44:44,420 --> 00:44:49,660
If the gold hadn't come,
you would have tried to attack us.

475
00:44:50,760 --> 00:44:53,400
If we fought...

476
00:44:54,720 --> 00:44:57,320
we'd kill each other.

477
00:44:57,920 --> 00:44:59,940
And that would only benefit Olof.

478
00:45:01,370 --> 00:45:02,690
And he...

479
00:45:03,380 --> 00:45:06,020
It is for this reason
that he took Beys' golds.

480
00:45:06,080 --> 00:45:08,080
Golds are mine.

481
00:45:08,160 --> 00:45:10,160
Mine, Osman!

482
00:45:16,260 --> 00:45:19,240
You will bring me the golds.

483
00:45:20,330 --> 00:45:22,510
I don't fall for Olof's game...

484
00:45:23,740 --> 00:45:25,420
nor for your game.

485
00:45:27,140 --> 00:45:31,720
If I attack Olof now, I will lose my warriors.

486
00:45:32,420 --> 00:45:36,340
As the gold is yours...

487
00:45:37,420 --> 00:45:39,600
Then you will go and fetch it.

488
00:45:40,260 --> 00:45:41,760
Tell me where it is.

489
00:45:42,260 --> 00:45:44,700
It's in the caravansary near Çamlıpınar.

490
00:45:44,700 --> 00:45:51,120
Then you will wait here until I
go and fetch the gold.

491
00:45:51,220 --> 00:45:53,220
No.

492
00:45:57,980 --> 00:46:00,880
I promised Beys that I would bring
their sons to them.

493
00:46:02,200 --> 00:46:04,060
I'll get out of here with Beys' sons.

494
00:46:07,220 --> 00:46:09,020
I will give you gold.

495
00:46:09,060 --> 00:46:11,060
Then...

496
00:46:27,580 --> 00:46:33,820
I'll take your head first, then the gold.

497
00:46:41,900 --> 00:46:43,420
Stop it, Nayman!

498
00:46:50,200 --> 00:46:52,220
Take me prisoner, Nayman.

499
00:46:54,380 --> 00:46:56,880
Then, you run and collect your dirty gold.

500
00:46:58,640 --> 00:47:00,720
If there is a game like you said...

501
00:47:04,840 --> 00:47:06,920
then you cut off my head and it's over.

502
00:47:19,560 --> 00:47:21,440
Give Beys to Osman...

503
00:47:22,720 --> 00:47:25,240
and arrest Turgut.

504
00:47:34,140 --> 00:47:35,500
We'll go.

505
00:48:11,380 --> 00:48:13,080
There was no other solution.

506
00:48:13,380 --> 00:48:14,900
You also know that.

507
00:48:18,020 --> 00:48:19,760
Never worry.

508
00:48:21,090 --> 00:48:23,090
I will get you safe from here.

509
00:48:23,140 --> 00:48:25,140
Yes, I know.

510
00:48:25,515 --> 00:48:28,015
Win for the Turks.

511
00:48:29,485 --> 00:48:31,185
We said fidelity, right?

512
00:48:34,345 --> 00:48:38,495
I sacrifice my life for you
and for this country.

513
00:48:38,605 --> 00:48:40,605
I do.

514
00:49:19,465 --> 00:49:20,955
Tell us, Bengi Hatun.

515
00:49:21,045 --> 00:49:23,565
Tell us what you did behind us.

516
00:49:23,705 --> 00:49:26,275
Did you have a hand
in poisoning my son?

517
00:49:26,345 --> 00:49:28,345
- If you...
- No!

518
00:49:29,985 --> 00:49:33,415
Ask Esma, I learned
when I got to the tribe.

519
00:49:33,435 --> 00:49:35,515
All this was a game from İsmihan.

520
00:49:37,905 --> 00:49:40,935
How do we know you're telling
the truth, Bengi Hatun?

521
00:49:40,975 --> 00:49:44,175
Why should I do such a thing on the morning
when I gave you my daughter?

522
00:49:45,015 --> 00:49:47,335
İsmihan must have taken
advantage of Esma...

523
00:49:47,565 --> 00:49:50,825
to not cooperate with you.

524
00:49:52,565 --> 00:49:55,725
Wasn't there anyone else
who could have poisoned the tribe?

525
00:49:58,855 --> 00:50:00,515
You didn't know about the poison.

526
00:50:00,545 --> 00:50:01,605
We get it.

527
00:50:01,685 --> 00:50:03,685
Well, what about the others?

528
00:50:04,145 --> 00:50:07,945
You worked with the cruels!
Frigg, Olof, İsmihan.

529
00:50:08,055 --> 00:50:11,415
You sat and watched, even though you
knew that İsmihan poisoned the people.

530
00:50:11,485 --> 00:50:14,125
They put my father in the castle
dungeon and you were silent!

531
00:50:14,155 --> 00:50:16,155
Did I have another choice, Bala Hatun?

532
00:50:16,425 --> 00:50:18,505
İsmihan is unlike anyone else.

533
00:50:18,625 --> 00:50:20,625
She can hurt people without thinking.

534
00:50:24,405 --> 00:50:26,245
You threatened to kill my daughter.

535
00:50:30,365 --> 00:50:35,805
Otherwise, am I someone who would
work with people who killed my brother?

536
00:50:36,425 --> 00:50:39,775
There was no strong family
behind me like you.

537
00:50:39,985 --> 00:50:41,555
I'm alone.

538
00:50:41,645 --> 00:50:43,645
I keep this family alive alone.

539
00:50:44,965 --> 00:50:46,745
Do I regret what I did?

540
00:50:50,205 --> 00:50:51,745
Yes.

541
00:50:53,185 --> 00:50:55,145
But I had no other choice.

542
00:51:00,425 --> 00:51:02,525
Understand this firstly.

543
00:51:04,865 --> 00:51:06,285
We now understand.

544
00:51:07,285 --> 00:51:10,905
But Esma will not remain unpunished.

545
00:51:10,945 --> 00:51:14,565
She poisoned my son, she will
definitely be held accountable.

546
00:51:16,345 --> 00:51:18,665
Esma has no guilt.

547
00:51:24,885 --> 00:51:26,205
Get up.

548
00:51:34,965 --> 00:51:36,805
The guilt is all mine.

549
00:51:38,065 --> 00:51:39,445
Alçiçek.

550
00:51:46,845 --> 00:51:47,855
My sister.

551
00:51:47,895 --> 00:51:49,785
My brother!

552
00:52:12,185 --> 00:52:15,045
Esma committed this sin because of me.

553
00:52:15,635 --> 00:52:19,415
Punish me, not her.

554
00:52:25,685 --> 00:52:27,845
We'll talk about this, Bengi Hatun.

555
00:52:28,725 --> 00:52:31,165
We will talk.

556
00:52:41,535 --> 00:52:44,255
Söğüt

557
00:52:44,875 --> 00:52:49,775
Osman will now try to draw
all Beys to his side.

558
00:52:50,835 --> 00:52:53,155
But we will not allow this, Celali.

559
00:52:54,015 --> 00:52:56,415
Your command, Mother Sultan.

560
00:53:04,345 --> 00:53:06,005
Say it, Celali.

561
00:53:07,055 --> 00:53:09,775
How are we going to stop
Nayman, Mother Sultan?

562
00:53:12,115 --> 00:53:14,175
No force can stop Nayman.

563
00:53:16,335 --> 00:53:20,095
Now I will go to Konya to speak with
Sultan Alaeddin about peace.

564
00:53:21,935 --> 00:53:28,315
The future of our land will be determined by the decisions that Sultan Aladdin and I will make.

565
00:53:29,175 --> 00:53:31,715
Your command, Mother Sultan.

566
00:54:32,595 --> 00:54:34,115
Frigg.

567
00:54:36,095 --> 00:54:37,675
Olof!

568
00:54:46,655 --> 00:54:47,955
Frigg.

569
00:54:50,655 --> 00:54:51,615
Olof!

570
00:54:51,625 --> 00:54:53,145
Frigg.

571
00:54:57,365 --> 00:54:58,905
Olof!

572
00:55:03,455 --> 00:55:05,975
I will hold everyone who did this
to you accountable!

573
00:55:08,945 --> 00:55:11,505
Frodi.

574
00:55:12,295 --> 00:55:14,095
Frodi.

575
00:55:19,615 --> 00:55:21,115
Frigg.

576
00:55:21,535 --> 00:55:22,765
How?

577
00:55:22,845 --> 00:55:24,845
How did you escape from them?

578
00:55:25,115 --> 00:55:27,795
On the road, let's talk on the road.

579
00:55:28,245 --> 00:55:31,945
Gold, gold is very important to Osman

580
00:55:32,175 --> 00:55:34,025
I heard that while they were talking.

581
00:55:34,125 --> 00:55:35,505
Why?

582
00:55:35,615 --> 00:55:37,935
Why is gold so important?

583
00:55:38,895 --> 00:55:41,515
I don't know, they were all so nervous.

584
00:55:41,935 --> 00:55:44,915
We have to get that gold, Olof

585
00:55:52,075 --> 00:55:53,855
Dan.

586
00:55:54,365 --> 00:55:56,155
They took him.

587
00:55:56,285 --> 00:55:58,285
Turgut took him.

588
00:56:00,955 --> 00:56:03,775
Since gold is very
important to Osman...

589
00:56:05,475 --> 00:56:08,795
They must make a deal with us.

590
00:56:10,375 --> 00:56:12,735
I know where the gold is.

591
00:56:14,585 --> 00:56:17,495
They hide it/them (golds) in
the caravansary near Çamlıpınar.

592
00:56:17,515 --> 00:56:18,795
Hurry up.

593
00:56:19,125 --> 00:56:20,475
Good.

594
00:56:20,505 --> 00:56:21,795
Well, we'll go.

595
00:56:21,895 --> 00:56:22,445
Let's go.

596
00:56:22,455 --> 00:56:25,495
This time, we'll hit Osman
from where he never expected.

597
00:56:26,035 --> 00:56:27,855
Come on, let's go.

598
00:56:45,935 --> 00:56:48,525
İnegöl Castle

599
00:56:49,085 --> 00:56:50,425
No.

600
00:56:52,165 --> 00:56:54,005
No, I can't wait that long.

601
00:56:55,695 --> 00:56:56,995
I will go.

602
00:57:00,575 --> 00:57:02,115
I'll go, however...

603
00:57:03,095 --> 00:57:04,615
Where am I going?

604
00:57:05,335 --> 00:57:07,435
Oh, Ülgen Hatun.

605
00:57:17,755 --> 00:57:19,395
I should have gone.

606
00:57:19,955 --> 00:57:22,835
I should have gone myself

607
00:57:23,955 --> 00:57:27,835
So far they have not come, I fear that
something bad has happened to her.

608
00:57:29,715 --> 00:57:31,215
Look at him.

609
00:57:31,995 --> 00:57:33,995
You will see now.

610
00:57:41,805 --> 00:57:43,305
Cerkutay.

611
00:57:43,775 --> 00:57:45,275
Cerkutay.

612
00:57:45,465 --> 00:57:47,105
I'm dying, Cerkutay.

613
00:57:47,285 --> 00:57:48,605
I'm dying.

614
00:57:48,795 --> 00:57:51,865
Cerkutay, I'm dying!

615
00:57:52,435 --> 00:57:54,305
Who did this to you?

616
00:57:54,405 --> 00:57:58,665
Tell me one thing before
I go to Allah.

617
00:57:58,945 --> 00:58:00,925
You'll be fine, I'll cure you.

618
00:58:00,955 --> 00:58:02,615
Do you love me?

619
00:58:02,615 --> 00:58:04,095
Tell me about this.

620
00:58:09,595 --> 00:58:10,835
Cerkutay.

621
00:58:12,115 --> 00:58:15,395
I'm dying, I'm dying, answer my question.

622
00:58:15,395 --> 00:58:16,695
Do you love me?

623
00:58:16,695 --> 00:58:18,695
Cerkutay.

624
00:58:18,995 --> 00:58:20,715
Ulgen Hatun.

625
00:58:20,815 --> 00:58:25,355
- I...love...
- You?

626
00:58:31,155 --> 00:58:33,775
Hey, don't pull it off!

627
00:58:33,835 --> 00:58:35,535
Don't pull it, Cerkutay...

628
00:58:35,615 --> 00:58:37,855
Don't pull it, I'll die instantly!

629
00:58:37,855 --> 00:58:39,675
I'll die, don't pull it!

630
00:58:39,675 --> 00:58:41,855
Why are you pulling it?
I will die...

631
00:58:46,775 --> 00:58:48,075
What is this?

632
00:58:50,435 --> 00:58:51,735
I was kidding

633
00:58:54,855 --> 00:58:56,235
Ulgen.

634
00:58:58,875 --> 00:59:00,155
Hey whatever!

635
00:59:00,615 --> 00:59:01,995
Hear what I have to say.

636
00:59:02,035 --> 00:59:04,275
Turgut Bey took dog Dan.

637
00:59:04,275 --> 00:59:05,555
And Olof was shot.

638
00:59:05,555 --> 00:59:07,555
Soon the longing will end, I hope.

639
00:59:09,135 --> 00:59:10,475
Nice.

640
00:59:16,435 --> 00:59:18,135
I was kidding you.

641
00:59:21,795 --> 00:59:23,335
Are you furious?

642
00:59:27,395 --> 00:59:28,755
Eh?

643
00:59:31,695 --> 00:59:34,075
Marmaracik Castle.

644
00:59:35,985 --> 00:59:39,545
Oh Allah, oh my Creator!

645
00:59:43,365 --> 00:59:46,725
What have you done, Alcicek?

646
00:59:48,075 --> 00:59:51,945
What did you do, my daughter?
I did everything just for you two.

647
00:59:53,275 --> 00:59:55,895
You burned us, Alcicek.

648
00:59:56,155 --> 00:59:59,105
You threw us to the fire.

649
00:59:59,335 --> 01:00:02,235
Do you think Ismihan
will let this go unpunished?

650
01:00:02,465 --> 01:00:04,705
You were hesitant.

651
01:00:04,855 --> 01:00:08,575
And I helped you decide
which side to choose.

652
01:00:08,735 --> 01:00:10,205
Daughter.

653
01:00:10,515 --> 01:00:15,685
Do you think Mother Sultan would let us
live if she heard of this? Don't you know?

654
01:00:15,885 --> 01:00:24,445
From now on, you will not stand
with Mother Sultan, but against her.

655
01:00:28,515 --> 01:00:30,555
How so?

656
01:00:33,275 --> 01:00:37,425
You're brave, Alcicek,
but you're ignorant.

657
01:00:37,685 --> 01:00:39,385
I am.

658
01:00:40,255 --> 01:00:47,235
I am ignorant, but I can see who cares
their people, not themself while you can't.

659
01:00:47,865 --> 01:00:51,745
Mother Sultan is selfish,
don't you see that?

660
01:00:52,275 --> 01:00:54,105
She only thinks of herself.

661
01:00:54,315 --> 01:00:58,465
But Osman Bey only thinks of his people.

662
01:01:08,525 --> 01:01:12,775
From now on, you either
side with Osman Bey...

663
01:01:13,995 --> 01:01:16,115
Or forget my abscene.

664
01:01:24,415 --> 01:01:26,145
She talked to you.

665
01:01:33,415 --> 01:01:35,975
Yenisehir

666
01:01:37,685 --> 01:01:41,185
If something happens to my son...

667
01:01:42,455 --> 01:01:45,545
I will demolish Yenişehir over his head!

668
01:01:45,705 --> 01:01:48,235
Talk about the good, Yakup Bey.

669
01:01:49,995 --> 01:01:52,265
Choose your words carefully.

670
01:01:52,965 --> 01:01:57,955
- Don't always talk evil.
- Man, where is the gold?

671
01:01:58,565 --> 01:02:01,195
Didn't we dedicate many alps to protect it?

672
01:02:01,395 --> 01:02:04,985
Apparently Osman Bey stole it.

673
01:02:05,165 --> 01:02:08,445
Basically I never wanted to give it to him.

674
01:02:09,135 --> 01:02:12,675
We die starving or we die fighting,
doesn't matter.

675
01:02:13,645 --> 01:02:15,985
Our campaign was not a brave campaign.

676
01:02:16,805 --> 01:02:22,125
But my son, may Allah protect him from the worst

677
01:02:26,015 --> 01:02:29,095
Attention!
Osman Bey!

678
01:02:32,565 --> 01:02:36,055
Sorry for keeping you waiting, Beys.

679
01:02:41,935 --> 01:02:44,175
Where is my son, Osman Bey?

680
01:02:45,555 --> 01:02:48,355
I brought your children safely.

681
01:02:50,735 --> 01:02:52,315
Boran.

682
01:03:03,935 --> 01:03:05,495
My valiant!

683
01:03:08,795 --> 01:03:10,385
Son!

684
01:03:14,045 --> 01:03:15,635
My child!

685
01:03:26,540 --> 01:03:30,080
Thank you Osman Bey, thank you.

686
01:03:30,460 --> 01:03:34,460
I can't thank you enough,
you shall find peace.

687
01:03:37,340 --> 01:03:41,360
Are you the one who
endangered our children's lives, Osman Bey?

688
01:03:42,070 --> 01:03:43,860
Where is the gold?

689
01:03:44,060 --> 01:03:46,170
Olof has it.

690
01:03:46,960 --> 01:03:49,610
Nayman will hold him accountable.

691
01:03:50,220 --> 01:03:52,820
I brought your children safely.

692
01:03:53,150 --> 01:03:55,290
The account has now been closed.

693
01:03:56,030 --> 01:03:59,030
What are you going to do now, Osman Bey?

694
01:03:59,920 --> 01:04:02,670
I will do what you couldn't do.

695
01:04:05,070 --> 01:04:07,080
I will fight.

696
01:04:08,120 --> 01:04:10,010
Don't do it, Osman Bey.

697
01:04:10,340 --> 01:04:17,700
I will do what a person with a brave heart does
even though they are few.

698
01:04:17,990 --> 01:04:26,040
I let go the Beys who are many but coward.

699
01:04:26,200 --> 01:04:30,050
- Osman Bey.
- You are not right at all, not even slightly.

700
01:04:31,370 --> 01:04:34,300
Don't talk, Yakup Bey.

701
01:04:35,370 --> 01:04:40,770
The war and victory shall be mine.

702
01:04:41,970 --> 01:04:43,670
Goodbye.

703
01:04:49,960 --> 01:04:52,100
Goodbye.

704
01:05:01,350 --> 01:05:02,800
Osman Bey.

705
01:05:04,860 --> 01:05:06,770
May Allah open your way.

706
01:05:16,650 --> 01:05:20,320
Thank you, Osman Bey.

707
01:05:21,590 --> 01:05:23,600
Eyvallah (Thanks).

708
01:05:34,020 --> 01:05:37,180
Caravansary
near Camlipinar

709
01:05:38,185 --> 01:05:41,215
Osman can't be that imprudent.

710
01:05:42,215 --> 01:05:44,785
Close all places, Frody.

711
01:05:45,035 --> 01:05:46,535
Be careful.

712
01:05:46,695 --> 01:05:51,935
Kill anyone who moves,
whether human or animal.

713
01:06:01,845 --> 01:06:03,375
Osman.

714
01:06:14,215 --> 01:06:16,915
Your death is here, Olof.

715
01:06:34,745 --> 01:06:36,855
Can I, father?

716
01:06:40,095 --> 01:06:42,185
Come on son.

717
01:06:59,295 --> 01:07:01,225
Son.

718
01:07:13,195 --> 01:07:15,465
Don't hurry, son.

719
01:07:15,665 --> 01:07:17,325
Let me, mother.

720
01:07:17,505 --> 01:07:20,275
Hatuns, let him.

721
01:07:21,625 --> 01:07:22,925
Let him.

722
01:07:23,005 --> 01:07:25,905
Let him come, come on.

723
01:07:26,035 --> 01:07:28,655
Come on boy, come on!

724
01:07:32,065 --> 01:07:33,235
Come here.

725
01:07:45,995 --> 01:07:49,025
Come, easy.

726
01:07:55,065 --> 01:07:58,755
Praise be to Allah!
Praise be to Allah!

727
01:07:58,885 --> 01:08:00,965
Praise be to Allah.

728
01:08:01,095 --> 01:08:04,895
I can walk, father.
Traitors couldn't reach their goal.

729
01:08:05,885 --> 01:08:08,685
You can, you can do it son.

730
01:08:08,935 --> 01:08:13,215
I also had this feeling
when you walked for the first time.

731
01:08:24,145 --> 01:08:26,585
Praise be to Allah, thank Him very much.

732
01:08:35,705 --> 01:08:37,285
But my arm...

733
01:08:39,854 --> 01:08:42,345
My arm isn't like how it used to be, father.

734
01:08:42,835 --> 01:08:46,774
It'll get better too, son.
You'll be like you used to be, Inshallah.

735
01:08:47,035 --> 01:08:51,154
Stay patienent, Orhan.
Patience leads to soundness.

736
01:08:52,965 --> 01:08:56,635
What did I tell you, son?

737
01:08:57,475 --> 01:09:01,604
You rise so that the state rises.

738
01:09:02,005 --> 01:09:07,515
Come on, come on, slowly, slowly

739
01:09:07,814 --> 01:09:10,135
Come, come here.

740
01:09:10,255 --> 01:09:15,175
Come son, come on, come here.

741
01:09:17,564 --> 01:09:19,085
Son...

742
01:09:19,085 --> 01:09:20,335
- Boran!
- My Bey!

743
01:09:20,335 --> 01:09:22,745
Bring the map and war gear.

744
01:09:22,745 --> 01:09:24,875
- As you order, my Bey.
- Go.

745
01:09:25,585 --> 01:09:27,794
Oh, my son.

746
01:09:38,265 --> 01:09:40,564
Praise be to Allah, Praise be to Allah

747
01:09:42,295 --> 01:09:50,685
I allowed your head to stay on your body
and you set your eyes on my gold, Olof?

748
01:09:51,104 --> 01:09:56,125
I spoke to you in the language you understand.

749
01:09:56,475 --> 01:09:59,765
But it turns out you're a fool!

750
01:10:00,805 --> 01:10:07,455
I heard that the gold
belonged to Osman, Commander

751
01:10:07,755 --> 01:10:12,315
Everything on these lands belongs to me!

752
01:10:12,775 --> 01:10:17,795
Gold and your head included!

753
01:10:44,475 --> 01:10:45,625
Frigg.

754
01:10:55,785 --> 01:10:58,915
I'll take both of them.

755
01:10:59,295 --> 01:11:05,205
The gold you stole will cause your death.

756
01:11:08,315 --> 01:11:11,265
Gold will eat everything.

757
01:11:11,475 --> 01:11:17,685
And you will go where you belong to,
the depth of the sea!

758
01:11:18,095 --> 01:11:21,325
I didn't do wrong to you, Commander

759
01:11:52,725 --> 01:11:54,535
Osman.

760
01:12:02,685 --> 01:12:04,745
Osman.

761
01:12:09,425 --> 01:12:14,825
We only have one advantage, which is
that Nayman is not in the headquarters.

762
01:12:15,155 --> 01:12:18,695
The only advantage, the only chance.

763
01:12:20,935 --> 01:12:30,435
Nayman's most skilled soldiers
stand around his headquarters.

764
01:12:30,735 --> 01:12:33,555
Even if our number is equal to them...

765
01:12:34,025 --> 01:12:39,275
...I can't guarantee victory
in the event of a battle.

766
01:12:40,195 --> 01:12:44,345
You say that victory is difficult even if
our numbers are equal, right, my Bey?

767
01:12:44,695 --> 01:12:48,395
Plus, their number
is already larger than us.

768
01:12:48,545 --> 01:12:52,185
We've figured everything out, Aktemur.
Now...

769
01:12:52,385 --> 01:12:56,845
They line up at five points
around the headquarters.

770
01:12:57,095 --> 01:12:58,845
Just like this.

771
01:12:59,315 --> 01:13:01,755
There are many Mongol soldiers
at those lines.

772
01:13:02,095 --> 01:13:07,005
Except for one of them.

773
01:13:07,185 --> 01:13:11,975
The number of soldiers here is small.
But they dug trenches on the way.

774
01:13:14,265 --> 01:13:16,605
We'll use that way.

775
01:13:17,825 --> 01:13:22,055
What about our horses?
How will the horses get over those trenches, Osman?

776
01:13:22,085 --> 01:13:27,615
We talked to the builders, they'll build
little birdges that horses can go through.

777
01:13:29,385 --> 01:13:35,325
The Bey of the neighboring tribes will
send their alps to our army.

778
01:13:35,525 --> 01:13:37,045
- Boran.
- My Bey!

779
01:13:37,105 --> 01:13:39,295
Archers will be at your command.

780
01:13:39,545 --> 01:13:41,995
You will shoot the guards.

781
01:13:42,225 --> 01:13:46,245
And then,
when we pass the bridges...

782
01:13:46,395 --> 01:13:50,935
We will attack with the alps
as the wolves attack the herd

783
01:13:51,545 --> 01:13:53,325
Your command, sir

784
01:13:53,535 --> 01:13:55,105
And then, Osman?

785
01:13:55,105 --> 01:14:00,655
You say they are five times larger than us.
What happens after we wipe out the first troop?

786
01:14:01,675 --> 01:14:05,245
They won't realise we came to attack.

787
01:14:05,425 --> 01:14:08,505
I will go in with the alps,
take Turgut Bey, and get out.

788
01:14:10,315 --> 01:14:14,815
If Nayman was at their head,
he'd stop them from coming after us.

789
01:14:14,995 --> 01:14:19,275
But they'll be eager to give
Osman Bey's head to Nayman

790
01:14:20,405 --> 01:14:22,255
...and when they come after us...

791
01:14:22,985 --> 01:14:25,035
I will take them.

792
01:14:26,175 --> 01:14:30,325
And I will wipe out those who come from the straits
that we set up beforehand.

793
01:14:33,335 --> 01:14:37,785
When the soldiers go out, the
headquarters will be defenseless.

794
01:14:38,545 --> 01:14:40,335
And then...

795
01:14:40,580 --> 01:14:42,190
From the south...

796
01:14:44,265 --> 01:14:48,385
Bala Hatun, you and
the cavalry will charge.

797
01:14:48,735 --> 01:14:50,625
Alright, Osman Bey.

798
01:14:51,195 --> 01:14:52,735
Malhun Hatun.

799
01:14:53,815 --> 01:14:59,705
You will attack with
infantry units from the north

800
01:15:00,355 --> 01:15:02,915
We will definitely collapse their world.

801
01:15:04,505 --> 01:15:06,665
It will be a tough war.

802
01:15:07,095 --> 01:15:09,305
We didn't think otherwise, my Bey.

803
01:15:09,875 --> 01:15:11,645
Eyvallah, eyvallah (thank you).

804
01:15:12,265 --> 01:15:17,715
The remaining troops
will be with you, Aktemur.

805
01:15:18,365 --> 01:15:19,975
As you order, my Bey.

806
01:15:21,855 --> 01:15:26,145
You have shown us how we will attack them.
But how can we achieve victory?

807
01:15:27,975 --> 01:15:31,715
Will these attacks be enough
to wipe out an army five times larger than us?

808
01:15:41,135 --> 01:15:45,035
The things that will wipe out the headquarters
are in the hands of the Mongol soldiers.

809
01:15:45,045 --> 01:15:51,095
They have stockpiles of weapons
and explosives in all four corners.

810
01:15:51,435 --> 01:15:55,245
And when we explode them,
they will split into four arms

811
01:15:55,665 --> 01:15:58,425
Then we will destroy them.

812
01:16:00,415 --> 01:16:05,095
Well, when we are all in this war,
Yenisehir will be unprotected.

813
01:16:18,035 --> 01:16:19,525
My Orhan.

814
01:16:24,085 --> 01:16:25,625
Son.

815
01:16:26,015 --> 01:16:31,505
While Orhan, son of Osman Bey, is in Yenişehir,
who says that it will be unprotected, mother?

816
01:16:32,025 --> 01:16:33,795
Praise be!

817
01:16:37,805 --> 01:16:39,925
Don't worry about it.

818
01:16:42,975 --> 01:16:45,205
Praise be to my son.

819
01:16:46,925 --> 01:16:50,705
That's my son.

820
01:16:57,995 --> 01:16:59,865
Everyone get ready in the morning.

821
01:17:00,325 --> 01:17:04,915
In these lands the sun will shine
only on believers.

822
01:17:36,085 --> 01:17:40,005
He first made you take the fake gold.

823
01:17:40,685 --> 01:17:45,525
And then he told me that
you had the gold.

824
01:17:46,435 --> 01:17:49,875
And he sent me here.

825
01:17:50,195 --> 01:17:57,685
Thus, you were going to kill me, and
thus he would have rid of his enemy.

826
01:17:58,425 --> 01:18:01,845
Osman thinks he's smart.

827
01:18:02,885 --> 01:18:06,655
But I will hit him from
the place he trusts the most

828
01:18:07,785 --> 01:18:13,225
You are here and so are we.

829
01:18:14,315 --> 01:18:16,645
What if he attacks Inegol?

830
01:18:17,285 --> 01:18:22,035
What if he attacks your headquarters?

831
01:18:22,725 --> 01:18:28,385
Olof, Osman scared you so much.

832
01:18:33,815 --> 01:18:38,195
I dispersed all their armies
and took their weapons from them.

833
01:18:39,265 --> 01:18:40,955
What will they attack?

834
01:18:41,455 --> 01:18:44,105
I'm not afraid of anyone, Commander.

835
01:18:45,075 --> 01:18:50,465
But underestimating Osman
will lead us to make mistakes.

836
01:18:52,315 --> 01:18:57,825
The old owner of your castle
Turgut has fallen into my hands

837
01:18:59,975 --> 01:19:04,765
And I will cut off his head if
Osman makes any small mistake.

838
01:19:08,305 --> 01:19:11,105
Send a messenger to Inegol.

839
01:19:12,035 --> 01:19:16,605
And let your army come here
early in the morning

840
01:19:18,315 --> 01:19:19,395
Why?

841
01:19:19,995 --> 01:19:24,115
We will unite your army with the Mongols
soldiers in the headquarters and...

842
01:19:24,115 --> 01:19:26,655
...we will march towards the tribe of Osman.

843
01:19:26,655 --> 01:19:36,245
And then Yenişehir, and then
we will erase everything related to the Turks.

844
01:19:38,425 --> 01:19:43,545
There is only one end
for those who want to trick me.

845
01:19:44,305 --> 01:19:45,855
Massacre!

846
01:19:53,395 --> 01:20:01,585
Turguts head will go to Osman's tent
before we do.

847
01:20:05,905 --> 01:20:07,495
Beautiful.

848
01:20:11,435 --> 01:20:13,985
Yeni Sehir.

849
01:20:25,985 --> 01:20:30,545
Alps, Hatuns.

850
01:20:31,510 --> 01:20:33,570
Today is the day of battle.

851
01:20:33,890 --> 01:20:36,530
Today is tournament day.

852
01:20:37,310 --> 01:20:40,030
Today is the day of shahada.

853
01:20:42,510 --> 01:20:44,830
Even if their number is more than us...

854
01:20:45,930 --> 01:20:48,110
We are the brave ones.

855
01:20:48,350 --> 01:20:50,260
We have faith.

856
01:20:55,300 --> 01:20:57,850
- Allah is the greatest!
- Allah is the greatest!

857
01:20:57,880 --> 01:21:00,670
- Allah is the greatest!
- Allah is the greatest!

858
01:21:00,700 --> 01:21:02,070
Allah is the greatest!

859
01:21:02,120 --> 01:21:04,810
- Allah is the greatest!
- Allah is the greatest!

860
01:21:10,310 --> 01:21:13,440
Praise be to Allah,
Praise be to Allah!

861
01:21:14,610 --> 01:21:16,660
And now our banner is up.

862
01:21:19,680 --> 01:21:20,820
Sons.

863
01:21:22,860 --> 01:21:26,590
You'll take care of our land
after we leave.

864
01:21:27,040 --> 01:21:30,780
Your lands are our lands, my Bey.
We will protect at the risk of our lives.

865
01:21:31,910 --> 01:21:33,550
Return with victory, my Bey.

866
01:21:34,275 --> 01:21:36,855
Thank you.

867
01:21:39,810 --> 01:21:41,260
May Allah bless you.

868
01:21:43,860 --> 01:21:46,130
- Boran.
- My Bey!

869
01:21:46,350 --> 01:21:49,410
-Bring me that dog!
-You command, my Bey.

870
01:22:10,620 --> 01:22:12,170
Osman Bey.

871
01:22:31,490 --> 01:22:35,020
My alps and horses are waiting ready
in front of the gates of Yenişehir

872
01:22:36,280 --> 01:22:39,130
If you'll allow me,
I also want to come with you, Osman Bey.

873
01:22:50,030 --> 01:22:53,120
Let this be your last change of sides,
Oktem Bey.

874
01:22:53,920 --> 01:22:59,280
And know that you have no place behind me
if you make any wrong choice after this.

875
01:23:00,130 --> 01:23:02,240
Okay, my Bey.

876
01:23:23,080 --> 01:23:25,080
Olof will avenge for me, Osman.

877
01:23:27,040 --> 01:23:32,250
As for me, I was fighting against
infidels like you Muslims and...

878
01:23:32,710 --> 01:23:34,230
Shut up...

879
01:23:38,550 --> 01:23:41,270
The infidels have always fought us.

880
01:23:41,800 --> 01:23:47,300
They have always wanted to kill our call.

881
01:23:49,200 --> 01:23:53,320
But their end is apparent.

882
01:23:54,200 --> 01:23:56,530
And this will be your end.

883
01:24:31,800 --> 01:24:33,190
- Boran,
- My Bey.

884
01:24:33,460 --> 01:24:37,180
-Now send this to Olof
-As you order, my Bey.

885
01:24:42,550 --> 01:24:45,930
Let's go!
May our battle be blessed!

886
01:25:37,060 --> 01:25:41,980
I bear witness that there is no God but Allah, and
I bear witness that Muhammad is His servant and Messenger

887
01:25:51,320 --> 01:25:53,620
Do you hear, Turgut?

888
01:25:53,900 --> 01:25:56,660
They want your blood

889
01:25:57,900 --> 01:26:00,270
You are now our guest

890
01:26:02,520 --> 01:26:05,920
That's why the arrow hasn't
hit your forehead yet.

891
01:26:08,610 --> 01:26:11,180
But when Neiman commands...

892
01:26:13,380 --> 01:26:17,050
I have great ideas for you!

893
01:26:19,010 --> 01:26:21,600
The real guests are you.

894
01:26:22,100 --> 01:26:24,960
And you'll understand
when I kill you with my own hands.

895
01:26:26,070 --> 01:26:27,380
But don't be sad.

896
01:26:27,710 --> 01:26:35,680
You'll see neither the demolish of your
headquarters nor the death of your soldiers.

897
01:26:37,750 --> 01:26:39,810
And they, too, will not see it.

898
01:26:39,920 --> 01:26:44,480
These are very challenging sentences
for a man whose hands are tied.

899
01:26:47,670 --> 01:26:52,930
When the order comes,
I'll put the rope around your neck

900
01:26:55,560 --> 01:26:59,800
I will ride your body on my horse

901
01:27:02,290 --> 01:27:04,830
You will, won't you?

902
01:27:05,950 --> 01:27:14,450
Soon your unbelieving feet will
not be able to take a step on this earth

903
01:27:16,230 --> 01:27:18,290
It will happen very soon

904
01:27:18,920 --> 01:27:20,460
Soldiers!

905
01:27:22,940 --> 01:27:24,780
Set the fire for the caldron.

906
01:27:25,040 --> 01:27:31,390
And when Nayman comes back,
we'll throw Turgut Bey in it.

907
01:27:37,240 --> 01:27:39,380
Come on, Osman Bey.

908
01:27:40,430 --> 01:27:42,610
Come here

909
01:27:46,010 --> 01:27:49,010
I know you will come

910
01:28:28,510 --> 01:28:31,195
While our father is fighting
this difficult battle...

911
01:28:31,195 --> 01:28:34,755
there is no room for us to make mistakes,
even for a moment, my brother

912
01:28:35,170 --> 01:28:37,450
We will keep here safe.

913
01:28:37,730 --> 01:28:41,100
Of course, brother.
We keep our promise.

914
01:28:53,470 --> 01:28:59,850
Even if my arm that
won't hold anything anymore...

915
01:29:02,720 --> 01:29:05,430
I still must triumph over
the healthy arm of the infidels.

916
01:29:06,600 --> 01:29:09,240
So that I can fulfill
the promise I made to my father.

917
01:29:10,490 --> 01:29:14,440
So that our nation rises.

918
01:29:16,770 --> 01:29:18,270
Orhan Bey.

919
01:29:19,530 --> 01:29:21,390
Everything you say will happen.

920
01:29:21,980 --> 01:29:23,520
Of course it will happen.

921
01:29:24,380 --> 01:29:27,690
And your arm will become
stronger than before, if Allah permits.

922
01:29:27,960 --> 01:29:29,500
I'm your brother

923
01:29:29,750 --> 01:29:31,600
And I know you more than yourself.

924
01:29:33,480 --> 01:29:35,370
I know that inside you is burning.

925
01:29:37,510 --> 01:29:38,820
My brother.

926
01:29:42,550 --> 01:29:44,695
While you show toughness to everyone...

927
01:29:44,715 --> 01:29:48,475
I know that you are afraid that
your arm might not be the same again.

928
01:29:48,500 --> 01:29:51,270
But let your brother say something.

929
01:29:52,040 --> 01:29:54,340
Your arm will be stronger than before.

930
01:29:59,380 --> 01:30:00,920
My valiant brother.

931
01:30:01,820 --> 01:30:03,550
Your brother will not collapse.

932
01:30:04,100 --> 01:30:06,540
And this arm will certainly
become stronger than ever

933
01:30:07,590 --> 01:30:10,180
And I will punish
whoever was the reason for this

934
01:30:10,570 --> 01:30:13,110
That's my brother!

935
01:30:13,990 --> 01:30:15,830
But we are not all talk.

936
01:30:16,200 --> 01:30:18,020
Kumral Abdal will help.

937
01:30:18,150 --> 01:30:19,460
We will practice.

938
01:30:20,730 --> 01:30:23,000
I will never slack, brother

939
01:32:46,950 --> 01:32:48,170
Come on, Alps!

940
01:33:53,770 --> 01:33:55,100
Come on.

941
01:34:02,680 --> 01:34:04,070
Come on!

942
01:34:19,530 --> 01:34:21,030
Praise be to Allah!

943
01:34:33,670 --> 01:34:35,180
Praise be to Allah!

944
01:34:50,900 --> 01:34:52,490
Praise be to Allah!

945
01:35:00,950 --> 01:35:02,680
Did you think I wouldn't come?

946
01:35:02,680 --> 01:35:04,560
I had no doubt, brother

947
01:35:30,270 --> 01:35:31,820
Catch them!

948
01:35:32,180 --> 01:35:34,240
Don't let them escape!

949
01:36:22,670 --> 01:36:24,020
O Allah

950
01:36:24,090 --> 01:36:25,480
O Allah

951
01:36:29,985 --> 01:36:31,725
Are you fine?

952
01:36:32,365 --> 01:36:33,725
I am.

953
01:36:33,815 --> 01:36:37,535
-I am fine, thanks to you, Osman Bey
-Praise be to God

954
01:36:42,025 --> 01:36:43,235
Beware.

955
01:36:43,685 --> 01:36:45,235
They will want revenge.

956
01:36:45,495 --> 01:36:48,775
Their pride will not tolerate this,
they will not leave us alone.

957
01:36:48,775 --> 01:36:51,815
No, we are the ones who
will not leave them alone

958
01:36:52,965 --> 01:36:57,175
Most of the soldiers are now
riding to Konur's trap.

959
01:37:27,305 --> 01:37:28,805
Allah is the greatest!

960
01:37:33,315 --> 01:37:35,095
Come on, alps.

961
01:37:37,685 --> 01:37:41,635
Now we will go to destroy the headquarters.

962
01:37:44,485 --> 01:37:46,375
May our conquest be blessed!

963
01:37:47,075 --> 01:37:49,265
May Allah accept our martyrs

964
01:37:49,625 --> 01:37:51,745
- Amen, amen!
- O Allah!

965
01:37:51,955 --> 01:37:53,255
Let's go!

966
01:37:58,705 --> 01:38:00,225
Alps!

967
01:38:00,645 --> 01:38:02,355
The field is ours now!

968
01:38:02,525 --> 01:38:03,835
O Allah!

969
01:38:03,835 --> 01:38:05,335
Let's go!

970
01:38:14,855 --> 01:38:16,365
Allah is the greatest!

971
01:38:22,135 --> 01:38:23,645
Allah is eternal!

972
01:41:03,885 --> 01:41:08,465
Do you know the story of
the lion and the wolf?

973
01:41:10,385 --> 01:41:12,475
In all the stories you tell...

974
01:41:12,475 --> 01:41:15,835
There will always be a lion and a wolf,
Kumaral Abdul

975
01:41:16,905 --> 01:41:18,615
Right, brother?

976
01:41:19,075 --> 01:41:20,455
No.

977
01:41:20,885 --> 01:41:22,885
You don't know this.

978
01:41:24,725 --> 01:41:27,005
This is the story of the black wolf.

979
01:41:34,845 --> 01:41:38,565
This wolf thinks of his people
before everything.

980
01:41:38,955 --> 01:41:40,985
He lives for his followers.

981
01:41:41,645 --> 01:41:46,685
He comes to the aid of all
those who fall into distress.

982
01:41:46,965 --> 01:41:49,275
Doesn't every hero have an enemy?

983
01:41:51,485 --> 01:41:54,185
There was an arrogant lion...

984
01:41:54,375 --> 01:41:56,585
...ruling the other side of the forest.

985
01:41:57,035 --> 01:41:58,375
That lion...

986
01:41:58,585 --> 01:42:00,375
He lives for himself.

987
01:42:00,375 --> 01:42:04,885
And he ignores his followers
for his desires and requests.

988
01:42:06,425 --> 01:42:09,435
It is the severity of vanity and
arrogance that afflicted him.

989
01:42:09,705 --> 01:42:11,925
He wiped out all his followers.

990
01:42:13,005 --> 01:42:16,445
He set his sights on the kingdom of wolf.

991
01:42:17,085 --> 01:42:21,435
Meanwhile, what do you think
the wolf did?

992
01:42:22,345 --> 01:42:24,085
What did the wolf do, valiants?

993
01:42:24,795 --> 01:42:28,645
He will not care about the size
of the lion and will punish him.

994
01:42:35,435 --> 01:42:38,775
It is very difficult for
the strength of the wolf to defeat the lion.

995
01:42:41,015 --> 01:42:42,835
He needs another way.

996
01:42:44,725 --> 01:42:46,065
A different one.

997
01:46:19,995 --> 01:46:22,845
Let everyone do their job!

998
01:46:36,805 --> 01:46:38,345
Oh Right!

999
01:46:41,805 --> 01:46:43,365
Oh Right!

1000
01:47:36,445 --> 01:47:38,005
Oh Right!

1001
01:48:55,245 --> 01:48:57,035
Hatuns.

1002
01:49:01,655 --> 01:49:05,005
Thank Allah, thank very much.

1003
01:49:07,785 --> 01:49:09,415
Many of them have run away, my Bey.

1004
01:49:11,655 --> 01:49:13,225
Let them.

1005
01:49:14,285 --> 01:49:16,525
They are the sign of our victory.

1006
01:49:16,875 --> 01:49:22,055
Let them run away so that they can speak of
our victory wherever they go.

1007
01:49:23,755 --> 01:49:25,735
Let them go.

1008
01:49:31,945 --> 01:49:44,975
Allah is the greatest!
Allah is the greatest!

1009
01:49:45,285 --> 01:49:47,075
Thank God!

1010
01:49:48,185 --> 01:49:49,975
Thank God!

1011
01:49:50,875 --> 01:49:53,115
Thank God, we won!

1012
01:49:53,115 --> 01:49:57,805
Thank Allah! Thank Allah! Thank Allah!

1013
01:50:00,265 --> 01:50:07,145
Take our wounded and martyrs
to the tents quickly.

1014
01:50:08,205 --> 01:50:12,125
We will increase our guard ten times!

1015
01:50:12,605 --> 01:50:14,555
Even twenty times!

1016
01:50:15,335 --> 01:50:17,285
We pulled out those dogs' teeth!

1017
01:50:17,565 --> 01:50:21,815
But they will continue to attack!

1018
01:50:22,405 --> 01:50:23,815
- Boran!
- My Bey!

1019
01:50:24,215 --> 01:50:25,815
Collect all the loot!

1020
01:50:26,505 --> 01:50:28,395
Look around the headquarters

1021
01:50:28,775 --> 01:50:32,795
We will never leave the right
of the oppressed to Nayman

1022
01:50:32,795 --> 01:50:35,305
Come on,
come on, brothers.

1023
01:50:42,325 --> 01:50:43,905
Thank Allah.

1024
01:50:46,315 --> 01:50:47,895
Thank Allah.

1025
01:50:50,985 --> 01:50:53,495
Wolves roam in
groups, Kumaral Abdul.

1026
01:50:53,695 --> 01:50:55,575
Doesn't this black wolf have a group?

1027
01:50:55,585 --> 01:51:00,165
It's the end of the world.
Even his group left the black wolf.

1028
01:51:02,325 --> 01:51:04,325
He has one solution left.

1029
01:51:05,385 --> 01:51:06,775
What is it?

1030
01:51:10,440 --> 01:51:12,940
He will hit the lion on his arrogance.

1031
01:51:16,380 --> 01:51:20,390
The lion was thinking of hitting the wolf.

1032
01:51:21,500 --> 01:51:25,670
But he did not expect that
the wolf would attack his forest.

1033
01:51:26,200 --> 01:51:30,280
That wolf would loot his belongings.

1034
01:51:31,000 --> 01:51:32,280
What happened, Komral Abdul?

1035
01:51:33,180 --> 01:51:37,050
The black wolf set the lions against each other.

1036
01:51:37,660 --> 01:51:40,110
And while they are fighting each other...

1037
01:51:41,390 --> 01:51:45,550
The wolf entered the lion's forest.

1038
01:51:45,900 --> 01:51:48,040
The wolf hit lion on his arrogance.

1039
01:51:48,920 --> 01:51:51,160
What is the reason for this victory, Komral Abdul?

1040
01:51:52,440 --> 01:51:56,870
Those who deserve to live the most
are those who risk their life.

1041
01:52:02,270 --> 01:52:06,470
The weakness of a lion and
the courage of a black wolf.

1042
01:52:08,040 --> 01:52:10,670
These brought the victory.

1043
01:52:13,930 --> 01:52:17,910
Thank Allah very much, I hope the story ends
this way all the time.

1044
01:52:18,150 --> 01:52:19,400
Hopefully.

1045
01:52:20,810 --> 01:52:22,070
Kumral Abdul.

1046
01:52:24,280 --> 01:52:26,590
Tell us about the loot.

1047
01:52:27,420 --> 01:52:29,130
What did the wolf get?

1048
01:54:25,285 --> 01:54:26,595
Who?

1049
01:54:31,575 --> 01:54:33,635
Who did this?

1050
01:54:39,395 --> 01:54:41,475
Who did this?

1051
01:54:42,835 --> 01:54:44,395
Osman.

1052
01:54:44,735 --> 01:54:46,295
Osman.

1053
01:54:53,875 --> 01:54:55,375
Osman.

1054
01:54:55,905 --> 01:54:57,475
Osman.

1055
01:54:57,795 --> 01:55:01,365
Your death will be at my hands

1056
01:55:05,045 --> 01:55:07,605
Are we going to let Osman go away
unpunished, Neiman?

1057
01:55:08,655 --> 01:55:10,915
Osman got us down at his game, Shaman.

1058
01:55:12,915 --> 01:55:16,115
I will rip out his heart with my own hands!

1059
01:55:19,745 --> 01:55:22,255
May God witness my words!

1060
01:55:22,565 --> 01:55:27,665
I will water the earth with his blood!

1061
01:55:36,005 --> 01:55:40,335
His children and alps!

1062
01:55:41,555 --> 01:55:43,765
I'll take them from him one by one!

1063
01:55:58,165 --> 01:56:00,675
Yeni Sehir

1064
01:56:20,685 --> 01:56:22,695
Praise be to Allah.

1065
01:56:23,595 --> 01:56:25,605
May your hands and hearts be blessed.

1066
01:56:26,175 --> 01:56:32,065
We've done a lot of damage to the
Nayman's army without the Beys' alps.

1067
01:56:32,065 --> 01:56:33,655
Thank Allah.

1068
01:56:35,455 --> 01:56:38,955
Tell me, Boran, what's up?

1069
01:56:39,395 --> 01:56:42,555
My Bey, thank Allah,
we have killed many Mongol soldiers.

1070
01:56:43,315 --> 01:56:45,885
Half of the number we killed escaped.

1071
01:56:46,145 --> 01:56:51,155
Nayman's most skilled guard soldiers died
in the blast.

1072
01:56:51,635 --> 01:56:54,045
Praise be!

1073
01:56:55,055 --> 01:57:00,255
We call this a victory, Osman Bey,
but half the army is still alive.

1074
01:57:00,735 --> 01:57:02,285
Certainly this is a victory

1075
01:57:03,295 --> 01:57:05,565
It is the biggest victory!

1076
01:57:06,155 --> 01:57:10,215
It is evidence of the possibility of the small overcoming
the great, and the few over the many

1077
01:57:10,555 --> 01:57:15,645
And the possibility of the oppressed
prevailing over the oppressor.

1078
01:57:18,365 --> 01:57:20,185
And what will happen now?

1079
01:57:20,235 --> 01:57:23,325
The soldiers will be afraid
and their hearts will tremble.

1080
01:57:23,915 --> 01:57:27,315
They will constantly
think if we attack them.

1081
01:57:28,355 --> 01:57:31,635
What about the people of the tribe?

1082
01:57:33,565 --> 01:57:35,605
They will have the courage

1083
01:57:35,855 --> 01:57:39,005
They will say that he who is said to be invincible
has been defeated

1084
01:57:39,275 --> 01:57:43,995
And they will want to join
this blessed army.

1085
01:57:44,685 --> 01:57:47,695
Thank Allah, my Bey.
Praise be to Allah.

1086
01:57:47,885 --> 01:57:50,975
Thank Allah.

1087
01:57:51,055 --> 01:57:52,935
Thank Allah.

1088
01:57:59,075 --> 01:58:00,435
My Bey!

1089
01:58:01,415 --> 01:58:02,955
When will we have the wedding?

1090
01:58:03,245 --> 01:58:06,385
Let the preparations begin
as soon as possible, we've got the girl.

1091
01:58:08,095 --> 01:58:10,195
No sense in waiting anymore.

1092
01:58:11,435 --> 01:58:17,755
Doing such a good deed in the
blessed months is much acceptable.

1093
01:58:18,635 --> 01:58:20,915
May Allah. bless them.

1094
01:58:20,915 --> 01:58:24,275
Amen

1095
01:58:27,605 --> 01:58:29,945
Sogut

1096
01:58:31,385 --> 01:58:34,455
Osman did it while we were in Konya.

1097
01:58:40,675 --> 01:58:42,695
Nayman will be here shortly.

1098
01:58:43,515 --> 01:58:45,095
Osman.

1099
01:58:45,795 --> 01:58:48,385
He poked the hornet's nest.

1100
01:58:50,485 --> 01:58:53,055
He destroyed Nayman's headquarters.

1101
01:58:53,995 --> 01:58:56,695
Shall we increase our protection,
Mother Sultan?

1102
01:58:56,755 --> 01:59:00,535
That will make Neiman more suspicious, Celali.

1103
01:59:01,625 --> 01:59:06,115
He would question
if we're in this or not.

1104
01:59:08,965 --> 01:59:10,675
Mother!

1105
01:59:14,610 --> 01:59:17,870
Are you also in this
game, Mother?

1106
01:59:18,980 --> 01:59:23,870
Did you know about Osman's
raid on my residence?

1107
01:59:27,430 --> 01:59:28,980
Soldiers!

1108
01:59:38,410 --> 01:59:41,140
Put your sword back in its nest, Celali.

1109
01:59:43,980 --> 01:59:46,020
Nayman is not our enemy.

1110
01:59:48,390 --> 01:59:50,890
I told you, Mother Sultan.

1111
01:59:51,350 --> 01:59:54,220
Either you end the resistance.

1112
01:59:55,160 --> 02:00:02,380
Or I will take
your son's head first and then yours.

1113
02:00:03,300 --> 02:00:07,590
And then the whole Konya and all borders!

1114
02:00:08,960 --> 02:00:11,580
You didn't find Osman with us
when you arrived.

1115
02:00:13,580 --> 02:00:15,480
This is the whole reason.

1116
02:00:18,370 --> 02:00:21,360
Osman is like couch grass.

1117
02:00:22,570 --> 02:00:26,440
When he's among us, he poisons us all.

1118
02:00:27,500 --> 02:00:30,040
He has no place in our unit.

1119
02:00:34,420 --> 02:00:37,020
There will be no resistance, however...

1120
02:00:38,010 --> 02:00:40,140
...I am not responsible for Osman Bey.

1121
02:00:41,940 --> 02:00:44,340
When the donkey dies on a mountain...

1122
02:00:45,400 --> 02:00:48,400
...the damage falls on the owner,
Mother Sultan.

1123
02:00:49,770 --> 02:00:55,040
The price for what he did
will be paid by all of you!

1124
02:00:55,550 --> 02:00:58,920
I will not pay for what Osman Bey did!

1125
02:00:59,900 --> 02:01:01,430
Have no doubt on this!

1126
02:01:01,600 --> 02:01:05,460
My hatred for Osman Bey
is more than your hatred for him.

1127
02:01:14,540 --> 02:01:22,130
And if the Beys were involved
in Osman's plan.

1128
02:01:23,780 --> 02:01:27,290
Tell them, I am, this time...

1129
02:01:28,740 --> 02:01:31,240
I'm not only going to take their children.

1130
02:01:32,280 --> 02:01:34,830
When Osman stole the gold from you

1131
02:01:35,690 --> 02:01:37,710
He had declared war on all of us.

1132
02:01:37,950 --> 02:01:39,780
And when the Beys learns this

1133
02:01:40,510 --> 02:01:45,030
They will know that the one who
harmed their children is Osman.

1134
02:01:49,910 --> 02:01:52,430
That's not enough, Mother!

1135
02:01:58,850 --> 02:02:00,430
Nayman!

1136
02:02:01,585 --> 02:02:06,165
Despite everything,
our promise to you remains.

1137
02:02:07,055 --> 02:02:11,195
Your taxes and gold will come to you.

1138
02:02:12,405 --> 02:02:16,935
You collect gold, however...

1139
02:02:20,665 --> 02:02:25,655
What Osman pays can only be his head now.

1140
02:02:28,105 --> 02:02:31,805
I will turn these lands into a lake of blood.

1141
02:02:33,255 --> 02:02:35,575
This is what you deserve.

1142
02:02:40,985 --> 02:02:45,505
Such charitable acts
are more acceptable in good months.

1143
02:02:45,705 --> 02:02:50,225
I want to give the booty
we took from Nayman...

1144
02:02:50,625 --> 02:02:52,515
...to our people.

1145
02:02:53,625 --> 02:02:55,475
It's a very good idea, Osman Bey.

1146
02:02:56,305 --> 02:02:59,475
Always help your followers.

1147
02:02:59,725 --> 02:03:01,055
Eyvallah.

1148
02:03:01,055 --> 02:03:05,005
Our Lord, who made us reach
these three months of goodness...

1149
02:03:05,505 --> 02:03:08,625
...shall honor us with the arrival
of the month Ramadan, Inshallah.

1150
02:03:08,845 --> 02:03:10,725
- Amen.
- Inshallah.

1151
02:03:11,645 --> 02:03:13,215
Sheikh grandfather.

1152
02:03:14,195 --> 02:03:15,995
I don't know how, but...

1153
02:03:16,295 --> 02:03:20,035
the pleasure of praying and reading
the Qur’an is completely different...

1154
02:03:20,035 --> 02:03:21,955
...when we enter the three months.

1155
02:03:29,395 --> 02:03:31,415
Do you feel the same way?

1156
02:03:37,485 --> 02:03:42,025
Just like this world has
four different seasons...

1157
02:03:42,675 --> 02:03:48,205
...these three months are a period
that touch our heart.

1158
02:03:48,945 --> 02:03:53,475
Each one has a
different meaning and effect on the soul.

1159
02:03:54,375 --> 02:03:57,455
The duties of the human
differ in each one of them.

1160
02:03:58,445 --> 02:04:00,145
For example...

1161
02:04:01,375 --> 02:04:02,915
The three months...

1162
02:04:03,475 --> 02:04:06,865
They are the months in which
the reward is like a flowing waterfall.

1163
02:04:07,255 --> 02:04:11,065
Whatever you do,
God will multiply it for you

1164
02:04:11,655 --> 02:04:17,165
God's mercy is multiplied
for His servants in these months.

1165
02:04:17,775 --> 02:04:24,205
The three months are the months of pardon
and forgiveness for the servants.

1166
02:04:26,045 --> 02:04:28,835
Our Lord forgives His servants a lot.

1167
02:04:29,745 --> 02:04:33,895
It is the months in which our
Lord forgives His repentant servants.

1168
02:04:34,675 --> 02:04:36,935
We must do what we must do.

1169
02:04:38,085 --> 02:04:39,635
We will pray often.

1170
02:04:40,665 --> 02:04:42,205
And we will worship a lot.

1171
02:04:43,045 --> 02:04:44,615
And we will repent a lot.

1172
02:04:45,795 --> 02:04:47,525
So that...

1173
02:04:48,255 --> 02:04:51,475
We are absolved of the sins
we have committed throughout the year.

1174
02:04:52,575 --> 02:04:55,265
And get rid of the sins we committed.

1175
02:04:56,425 --> 02:04:57,845
To be good Muslims.

1176
02:04:59,605 --> 02:05:01,345
Not just for ourselves

1177
02:05:02,415 --> 02:05:06,495
In fact, for the sake of the nation of
Muhammad, all of us will be good Muslims

1178
02:05:07,765 --> 02:05:11,205
For Kayı, and for Yenişehir

1179
02:05:11,845 --> 02:05:15,695
For the sake of the Islamic world
and for the whole world

1180
02:05:16,195 --> 02:05:17,595
We will be good Muslims

1181
02:05:21,565 --> 02:05:23,175
And even for the infidels.

1182
02:05:24,015 --> 02:05:33,525
Because it is easy for infidels
to see the right when we are good Muslims

1183
02:05:33,825 --> 02:05:36,885
A Muslim is defined by his/her way of life.

1184
02:05:37,385 --> 02:05:44,355
Our life will be so beautiful and clean
that the unbeliever will long for it.

1185
02:05:45,295 --> 02:05:48,395
And the oppressor will be
ashamed of their injustice.

1186
02:05:49,035 --> 02:05:53,525
For this reason,
we must value our worship.

1187
02:05:54,715 --> 02:06:00,235
We will move away from lies,
hypocrisy and lack of justice...

1188
02:06:00,905 --> 02:06:05,485
...as we stay away from the fire of hell.

1189
02:06:06,545 --> 02:06:10,205
So that we show the truth beautifully...

1190
02:06:11,005 --> 02:06:14,455
So that our words affect even the unbeliever.

1191
02:06:15,895 --> 02:06:17,755
You're right, my sheikh.

1192
02:06:18,325 --> 02:06:19,855
It is not enough to talk about it.

1193
02:06:20,715 --> 02:06:22,325
The important thing is to live it.

1194
02:06:23,055 --> 02:06:26,355
These months are an opportunity
for all of us.

1195
02:06:27,105 --> 02:06:32,565
It is an opportunity to live as Muslims
and get rid of the sins we have committed

1196
02:06:36,765 --> 02:06:39,195
Don't waste this opportunity

1197
02:06:40,455 --> 02:06:46,565
With sincere repentance,
we repent with faith and hold fast to our worship.

1198
02:06:47,205 --> 02:06:49,275
I hope so my sheikh.

1199
02:06:50,355 --> 02:06:54,025
This is what we intend,
May Allah let us reach our intentions.

1200
02:06:54,445 --> 02:06:56,575
- Amen.
- Amen.

1201
02:06:56,855 --> 02:07:01,635
The three months herald us for the feast.

1202
02:07:02,515 --> 02:07:05,445
They announce the feast, so...

1203
02:07:06,045 --> 02:07:09,125
Let us receive it with a
beautiful religious chant.

1204
02:07:09,815 --> 02:07:11,395
Dear Boran.

1205
02:07:11,645 --> 02:07:13,435
Of course, my sheikh.

1206
02:07:14,075 --> 02:07:15,385
Eyvallah.

1207
02:07:17,095 --> 02:07:18,395
My Bey.

1208
02:07:18,915 --> 02:07:20,795
Play your Komuz.

1209
02:07:21,375 --> 02:07:22,895
Your command, my Bey.

1210
02:07:36,885 --> 02:07:44,125
You hit me

1211
02:07:46,885 --> 02:07:54,945
The fire of love and adoration of Muhammad

1212
02:07:58,885 --> 02:08:04,065
Muhammed

1213
02:08:05,055 --> 02:08:12,965
I am for you.

1214
02:08:16,455 --> 02:08:23,655
I am for your love.

1215
02:08:24,755 --> 02:08:29,475
Muhammed

1216
02:08:31,355 --> 02:08:36,535
I was struck by the fire of love
and adoration of Muhammad

1217
02:08:36,975 --> 02:08:41,815
I am for him, the path of Muhammad lover

1218
02:08:42,395 --> 02:08:47,285
Those who are his nation
constantly praise and praise Allah.

1219
02:08:47,745 --> 02:08:53,225
Make me a lover of Muhammad.

1220
02:08:58,435 --> 02:09:03,555
Put the love of Muhammad in my heart

1221
02:09:03,865 --> 02:09:08,825
And make me a lover of Muhammad only

1222
02:09:09,225 --> 02:09:14,495
I was struck by the fire of love and
adoration of Muhammad

1223
02:09:14,575 --> 02:09:20,175
I am for him, the path of Muhammad lover

1224
02:09:25,235 --> 02:09:30,565
And leave me as a lover in his way.

1225
02:09:30,735 --> 02:09:36,495
And make me crazy about Muhammad.

1226
02:09:41,495 --> 02:09:46,635
He always carried his nation's
concern and did not enjoy anything

1227
02:09:46,865 --> 02:09:51,865
You are the dignity of this nation,
O Muhammad

1228
02:09:52,175 --> 02:09:57,205
I was struck by the fire of love
and adoration of Muhammad

1229
02:09:57,585 --> 02:10:02,885
I am for him,the path of Muhammad lover

1230
02:10:13,725 --> 02:10:18,775
He called for the forgiveness
for the sins of the nation, that King of Kings

1231
02:10:19,075 --> 02:10:24,785
We have no fear on the day of punishment,
thanks to Muhammad

1232
02:10:29,845 --> 02:10:34,855
Honor me with your kind generosity, O Allah

1233
02:10:35,215 --> 02:10:40,215
Add a drop of Muhammad's sea to me

1234
02:10:40,535 --> 02:10:45,415
I was struck by the fire of love
and adoration of Muhammad

1235
02:10:45,945 --> 02:10:51,275
I am for him and the path of Muhammad lover

1236
02:11:01,995 --> 02:11:07,115
Wipe your black face with the footprints
of the virtuous teacher (refers to Muhammed)

1237
02:11:07,235 --> 02:11:13,275
If he is kind to me,
he will let me see Muhammad

1238
02:11:18,185 --> 02:11:23,315
His late community want to see him on earth.

1239
02:11:23,465 --> 02:11:28,485
Will it be easy to meet
the dust of Muhammad's feet?

1240
02:11:28,915 --> 02:11:33,995
I was struck by the fire of love
and adoration of Muhammad

1241
02:11:34,335 --> 02:11:39,355
I am for him,
the path of Muhammad lover

1242
02:11:39,645 --> 02:11:44,755
I was struck by the fire of love and adoration of Muhammad

1243
02:11:45,085 --> 02:11:50,875
I am for him, the path of Muhammad lover

